K3 MLA AI is ~100+ FLOP/byte for s>=1k, so it is compute-bound;
TFLOPS/%TC count the full S^2 (repo convention); a causal kernel skips ~half
of the S^2 tiles, so real tensor-core utilization is ~0.5x the printed %TC.

